	(text "1. +5V MAIN BUCK  LM5148 (80 V sync buck controller)  VIN 9-50 V -> 5V_BUCK = 5.13 V, 8 A, fsw 300 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "df0131ef-bd26-5c5c-9414-c94e0d8b96cd")
	)
	(text "fsw = 1e6/(45*73.2k+53) = 299 kHz; tON at 50.4 V = 340 ns >> 50 ns min; dropout below ~5.3 V (VIN UVLO is 8 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a955b15-c3ac-5536-bea1-b05171f4406c")
	)
	(text "L = 4.7 uH: dI = 3.25 A p-p at 48 V, 2.7 A at 20 V. Slope comp: L_ideal = Vo*Rs/(24*f) = 2.85 uH -> 1.65x (stable)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9dec86ca-c890-5e16-9df5-cf51d25e55eb")
	)
	(text "Rs = 4 mOhm, VCS-TH 49/60/73 mV -> peak limit 12.3/15/18.3 A, DC >= 10.6 A at 48 V; short-circuit peak 18.7 A < 24 A Isat."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8da14bce-bf5b-5bed-84a3-16a4e675f256")
	)
	(text "Comp (gm 1.2 mS, Gcs 10): RCOMP 10k, CCOMP 10n (zero 1.6 kHz), CHF 100p (pole 159 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "48461ab6-1b93-53c7-8fbe-8b72d8fc56f7")
	)
	(text "  fc = 18 kHz with ~430 uF total (+5V bulk + ceramics); 52 kHz with buck-side ceramics only (~150 uF) - both < fsw/5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a41ae18f-122b-52d1-931b-20699f5e3047")
	)
	(text "PFM/SYNC = VDDA: diode emulation, no negative inductor current (cannot pump +5V energy back into VIN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f806194-6702-5987-94c9-f8727da116bb")
	)
	(text "VCCX = own output (> 4.3 V): gate drive from 5 V instead of the VIN LDO (saves ~0.5 W at 48 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d222d31b-7f93-5ddf-8df0-424bffa9ff17")
	)
	(text "Loss at 8 A: ~2.6 W (20 V in, 94 %), ~3.6 W (48 V in, 92 %); incl. OR-FET + INA shunt: 93.3 % / 91.4 %."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccd51a25-4f9d-596e-bda7-4a78f72f905e")
	)
	(text "2. BACKFEED BLOCK  5V_BUCK -> ideal diode (LM74700 + BSC0901NS) -> 5V_OR -> 2 mOhm shunt -> +5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b654e02-388b-5d15-bba1-0989270ddf4e")
	)
	(text "PROBLEM: in bus-powered mode +5V is fed from laptop VBUS (sink switch, power_laptop sheet) while VIN is absent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 292.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4470eb00-8a67-5405-aa6c-64ab63d57330")
	)
	(text "A plain sync buck would conduct +5V -> L -> Q301 body diode -> VIN (~4.3 V on VIN, which would also wake the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "98947ab4-1e6c-578e-ae7c-65bdef1f3dc2")
	)
	(text "LM51770 buck-boost at its 3.5 V UVLO and the LM5148's VOUT->VIN ESD diode would conduct too)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 297.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ff13e637-f254-5da2-a1ef-c5ff1d70f127")
	)
	(text "FIX: the buck regulates its own node 5V_BUCK; LM74700 + Q303 form an ideal diode 5V_BUCK -> +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 299.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62d8d2cc-8a1c-505c-a9b6-972e0bb832a2")
	)
	(text "  VIN absent: LM74700 unpowered (ANODE ~0 V), Q303 off, its body diode reverse-biased -> zero reverse current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 302.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3a4b9fc4-ec91-5ffa-9da4-278c56aad481")
	)
	(text "  Buck running: Q303 regulated to 20 mV forward drop (0.16 W at 8 A); reverse current -> gate pulled in <0.75 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 304.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e2d5f697-d7ad-517a-982d-3f6cbc09431d")
	)
	(text "  Nothing on this sheet ties VIN-side pins to +5V (FB, VCCX, VOUT/ISNS+, PG pull-up all on 5V_BUCK)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 307.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "457d4d56-c59e-5072-96a5-f156eae2fd85")
	)
	(text "  VIN at a few volts: EN/UVLO divider keeps the LM5148 off below 7.0-8.0 V, D301 isolates its VIN pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 309.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b59edbb2-6955-5c7d-bfc8-a29a9bce3f19")
	)
	(text "Handover: external power arrives -> buck soft-starts (3 ms) into 5V_BUCK -> diode conducts once 5V_BUCK > +5V,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 312.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d758d20-c0e9-58ca-8967-ac5b47f6eb9d")
	)
	(text "  +5V rises 5.0 -> 5.11 V; PG_5V (global, open drain, 100k to 5V_BUCK = 5.1 V level) goes high and, after a"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 314.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "084691bd-f3e9-5cd5-aecf-e51fbbbf8b37")
	)
	(text "  2.7-6.7 ms RC on power_laptop, opens the sink switch (EXT_PWR_PRESENT AND PG_5V). Make-before-break."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 317.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e8027a7-6812-5364-ae4f-f8374df156f6")
	)
	(text "  PG_5V pull-up is deliberately 5V_BUCK, not +3V3/+5V: those exist while the LM5148 is unpowered (open-drain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4cbf856f-a162-52fc-84df-3379a34dac12")
	)
	(text "  PG floating) and would read 'good' exactly in the hand-over window. Do not feed PG_5V to 3.3 V-only inputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 322.58 0)
